    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Arrays - running count</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/max-consecutive-ones/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 485</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Max Consecutive Ones</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Keep two numbers while you scan: the length of the run of 1s that ends here, and the best run so far. A 1 extends the run, a 0 resets it. One pass, O(n) time, O(1) space. Easy on its own, but it is the base case of the \"longest window with at most k zeros\" family that Meta and Google ask next.</p>\n"
